an","name":"Siracusan Civilian","icon":"/enemies-icons/Siracusan Civilian.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"These Siracusan civilians seem to have strayed into the fighting despite having been evacuated along with the rest of the crowd earlier. For whatever reason, whenever an accident of any sort happens, everyone's wrath falls upon you.","abilities":["Gradually reduces Blood Debt over time while on the battlefield; however, increases Blood Debt by a significant amount upon dying"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":0,"def":50,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":null}},"elite_famiglia_crossbowman":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_crossbowman","name":"Elite Famiglia Crossbowman","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Crossbowman.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Famiglia-trained crossbowmen with a wealth of experience. Their shots are more accurate, and more deadly as well. Famiglie always respect the ironclad order, so these crossbows are never upgraded into better models, and Arts remain just as essential as ever.","abilities":["While under the Asset Liquidation status, attacks are converted into Arts damage"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":5500,"atk":380,"def":200,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"elite_famiglia_caster":{"slug":"elite_famiglia_caster","name":"Elite Famiglia Caster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Famiglia Caster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A skilled Caster can often turn the tide of a battle. Though these claim to hold formidable positions, everyone knows they are nothing without the protection of their famiglia.","abilities":["Attacks two targets simultaneously.","Can stop attacking to continually increase Blood Debt"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":6000,"atk":400,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3.5}},"famiglia_soldier":{"slug":"famiglia_soldier","name":"Famiglia Soldier","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Soldier.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Low-level mafiosi who obey the orders of their superiors unquestioningly. Their lives are hardly worth anything, but their deaths are sufficient cause for their famiglia to seek revenge.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt by a miniscule amount when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":3500,"atk":320,"def":120,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"famiglia_luxury_limo":{"slug":"famiglia_luxury_limo","name":"Famiglia Luxury Limo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Luxury Limo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A lesser-seen vehicle among the famiglie, sporting an unassuming exterior but a luxurious interior. Generally, these are only used to welcome the most distinguished of the famiglia's guests, and to convey to them the graces of the famiglia's high-ranking members.","abilities":["Unloads 3 <Elite Famiglia Soldiers> if this is unit is defeated while blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.2,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1100,"def":1300,"res":15,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"famiglia_heavy_capo":{"slug":"famiglia_heavy_capo","name":"Famiglia Heavy Capo","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Heavy Capo.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A ruthless famiglia capo who has commanded the awe of a great many mafiosi. He was there when the famiglie first rose to greatness, and withstood the tumultuous years of change up until the present. It seems that nothing can topple him now.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt whenever an enemy unit is defeated within range"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9500,"atk":600,"def":500,"res":25,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"famiglia_shadow_silencer":{"slug":"famiglia_shadow_silencer","name":"Famiglia Shadow Silencer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Shadow Silencer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A peerless assassin loyal to his famiglia. The shadows serve his will, and he knows murder better than the back of his hand. He can be found in the background of every secret that has allowed his famiglia to rise and flourish, and those who have seen his true face are already buried six feet under.","abilities":["Gains additional buffs while under Asset Liquidation","Invisible"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":18000,"atk":1050,"def":800,"res":45,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png","act21side_token_permesso_rep_1":"/item-icons/permesso_di_importazione_act21side_token_permesso_rep_1.png"},"previewFile":"is-s-3.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[{"col":0,"description":null,"hidden":false,"key":"trap_092_vgctrl","kind":"device","name":"Vengeful Mafioso","row":0}],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[8,5],[7,5],[6,5],[5,6],[4,6],[3,6],[2,6],[1,5],[0,5]],"distances":[0,1,2,3.414213562373095,4.414213562373095,5.414213562373095,6.414213562373095,7.82842712474619